From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:43:42 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 57/69] Meridian: a speaker on tabs that play sound; Mute Tab

Today rows, pinned rows and favorite tiles show a speaker while their tab
plays sound or is muted; clicking it mutes or unmutes without switching
tabs. The tab and pinned menus offer Mute Tab / Unmute Tab
(SidebarHandler::SetTabMuted).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
